From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:27:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Arctic volume closure of GLORYS's gateway transports;
 download-only mode; 2005 run file

glorys_gateways_native.jl: the Arctic inside the four gateway lines and Fury and
Hecla Strait (flood fill on GLORYS's grid from the pole, with a leak check), its
volume from daily zos, and glorys_arctic_budget.csv: gateways + Fury and Hecla
against A d<eta>/dt (residual expected about -0.17 Sv, runoff + P - E).
panarctic_nested.jl: PANARCTIC_DOWNLOAD_ONLY=1 builds everything (downloading
the run's data) and stops before the first step.
runs/tsubouchi-2005-15km-2mo.toml: September-October 2005 at 15 km.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvmJrXadb5LQWtyUVrz
